{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52029","headline":"山家夏日九首 一 · 王绩","name":"山家夏日九首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞坐山家，萧条翫物华。\n树奇（李抄本作「倚」）全拥石，蒲长半侵砂。\n池光连壁动，日影对窗斜。\n石榴兼布叶，金䔲唯作花。\n落藤斜引蔓，伏笋暗抽芽。\n高卧长无客，方知人事赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}